instruction:
Extract structured fields from an Australian home-insurance claim
narrative. Return a single JSON object matching this schema exactly:
{
  "$defs": {
    "ClaimType": {
      "enum": [
        "storm",
        "flood",
        "fire",
        "theft",
        "accidental_damage",
        "escape_of_liquid",
        "malicious_damage",
        "glass_breakage",
        "other"
      ],
      "title": "ClaimType",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "properties": {
    "claim_type": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ClaimType"
    },
    "date_of_loss": {
      "format": "date",
      "title": "Date Of Loss",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "cause": {
      "description": "Short free-text cause, e.g. 'burst pipe under kitchen sink'",
      "title": "Cause",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "damaged_item": {
      "description": "What was damaged, e.g. 'kitchen ceiling and cabinetry'",
      "title": "Damaged Item",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "estimated_amount": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "number"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Claimant's estimated repair/replacement cost in AUD",
      "title": "Estimated Amount"
    },
    "policy_number": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "description": "Policy number if mentioned in the narrative, else null",
      "title": "Policy Number"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "claim_type",
    "date_of_loss",
    "cause",
    "damaged_item"
  ],
  "title": "ClaimExtraction",
  "type": "object"
}

Rules:
- Only extract what the narrative actually states or clearly implies -- never guess
  or invent a value.
- claim_type "flood" applies ONLY when water escaped the normal confines of a lake,
  river, creek, dam, or other named natural watercourse. Any other rain-caused loss
  (wind-driven rain, roof ingress, drainage overwhelm, surface water pooling with no
  named watercourse) is "storm", regardless of rainfall volume.
- estimated_amount and policy_number must be null if the narrative doesn't mention them.
- Output ONLY the JSON object, no other text, no markdown code fences.

